<title>SPAIN: Spain's Alba 1Q net profit up at 3.8 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Alba 1Q net profit up at 3.8 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish holding Corporacion Financiera Alba said on Monday it had first quarter net profit of 3.8 billion pesetas versus 1.81 billion pesetas in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>In a statement, the firm added that the results include an extraordinary gain of 1.82 billion pesetas due to the selling of a stake in Formentera Interplan.</p>
<p>Alba, which cancelled five percent of its treasury stock in 1996, has a new shareholders capital of 14.40 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
